---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
---

<Site
	title="Progress"
	section="progress"
	description="Solmara is being built a piece at a time. Where it is now, and what comes next."
	eyebrow="Progress"
	heading="It is early"
	lede="Solmara is being built a piece at a time. When there is something to try, it will be here and under Releases on GitHub."
>
	<section>
		<ol class="stages">
			<li class="now"><strong>In development</strong><span>Now. Nothing to download yet.</span></li>
			<li><strong>Preview</strong><span>A first download to try.</span></li>
			<li><strong>Beta</strong><span>Ready for real songs.</span></li>
			<li><strong>1.0</strong><span>Stable.</span></li>
		</ol>
	</section>

	<section class="prose">
		<h2>Follow along</h2>
		<p>The work happens in the open: watch <a href="https://github.com/mattias800/solmara">the repository on GitHub</a> to hear when a preview is out, and <a href="https://github.com/mattias800/solmara/issues/new/choose">tell us</a> what you would like Solmara to do.</p>
	</section>
</Site>
